WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.750
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.020 --> 01:43.940
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.220 --> 01:46.820
[Episode 3]

4
01:49.789 --> 01:50.720
Liu Zhengliang.

5
01:51.310 --> 01:52.430
What kind of place do you think

6
01:52.430 --> 01:53.759
Xiaoximen Hospital is?

7
01:53.950 --> 01:55.840
One you can just come and go?

8
01:57.120 --> 01:58.400
Didn't we agree?

9
01:58.870 --> 02:00.200
Once Liu Zhengguang's surgery is over,

10
02:00.200 --> 02:01.000
I'll leave.

11
02:01.120 --> 02:02.580
Have you lost your memory?

12
02:03.150 --> 02:04.150
We agreed you'd stay

13
02:04.150 --> 02:05.400
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

14
02:05.400 --> 02:06.680
You raised the price,

15
02:06.680 --> 02:08.139
and I reluctantly agreed.

16
02:09.470 --> 02:10.310
Who'd want to stay at a hospital

17
02:10.310 --> 02:11.710
where the director barbecues in his office

18
02:11.710 --> 02:13.150
in broad daylight?

19
02:16.430 --> 02:18.400
Then what about the contract you signed?

20
02:18.400 --> 02:19.079
No problem.

21
02:19.360 --> 02:20.630
I can pay the penalty.

22
02:28.310 --> 02:30.030
WeChat or cash, either works.

23
02:32.150 --> 02:33.560
Can I pay in installments?

24
02:33.560 --> 02:34.590
Never heard of that.

25
02:34.590 --> 02:35.030
Around here,

26
02:35.030 --> 02:36.120
we only do one-time deals.

27
02:36.120 --> 02:37.150
What do you mean?

28
02:37.240 --> 02:38.280
Are you in the mob?

29
02:38.710 --> 02:39.520
Let me tell you,

30
02:39.520 --> 02:41.310
we live under the rule of law.

31
02:41.630 --> 02:43.079
Even if I insist on going,

32
02:43.079 --> 02:44.240
what can you do about it?

33
02:44.240 --> 02:45.500
Tie me up or something?

34
02:46.870 --> 02:47.750
What?

35
02:48.840 --> 02:50.400
You think running back to Guangdong

36
02:50.400 --> 02:52.000
will put you beyond my reach?

37
02:52.710 --> 02:54.590
I've got connections in Guangdong too.

38
02:54.590 --> 02:57.790
My classmate heads the South China Medical Association.

39
02:58.120 --> 02:59.870
I'll spread the word

40
03:00.190 --> 03:01.910
about your malpractice and unpaid debts.

41
03:01.910 --> 03:02.840
How do you like that?

42
03:02.840 --> 03:04.770
What hospital would hire you then?

43
03:06.470 --> 03:07.360
I'm sick!

44
03:07.360 --> 03:08.240
You? Sick?

45
03:08.710 --> 03:09.430
I mean it. I'm sick.

46
03:09.430 --> 03:10.240
I'm really sick.

47
03:10.240 --> 03:12.840
I'm scared of snow (sounds like "blood" in Chinese).

48
03:12.840 --> 03:13.470
What?

49
03:14.030 --> 03:14.910
You don't see blood during brain surgery?

50
03:14.910 --> 03:16.150
Not that kind of blood.

51
03:16.150 --> 03:17.350
Snow, as in snowfall.

52
03:18.120 --> 03:19.430
The stuff that comes fluttering down

53
03:19.430 --> 03:20.240
from the sky.

54
03:20.750 --> 03:21.710
Snow phobia?

55
03:25.400 --> 03:27.060
You're really pulling my leg.

56
03:27.520 --> 03:29.120
I've been a doctor for years,

57
03:29.400 --> 03:31.000
and I've never heard of that condition.

58
03:31.000 --> 03:32.840
Look it up if you don't believe me.

59
03:32.840 --> 03:33.710
Chionophobia

60
03:33.910 --> 03:35.310
is a rare condition.

61
03:35.360 --> 03:36.280
Most sufferers have experienced

62
03:36.280 --> 03:37.470
a serious accident

63
03:37.520 --> 03:38.710
on a snowy day.

64
03:38.750 --> 03:39.680
Just like me.

65
03:39.960 --> 03:41.030
When I see snow,

66
03:41.079 --> 03:42.470
I feel disgusted

67
03:42.470 --> 03:44.360
and have panic attacks.

68
03:44.680 --> 03:45.710
I even experience

69
03:46.079 --> 03:47.910
severe physical symptoms.

70
03:47.910 --> 03:49.030
I get a rapid heartbeat

71
03:49.030 --> 03:50.400
and shortness of breath.

72
03:50.400 --> 03:51.240
I even feel

73
03:51.240 --> 03:52.120
like I'm suffocating,

74
03:52.120 --> 03:52.800
like I'm about to die...

75
03:52.800 --> 03:53.400
What's that got to do

76
03:53.400 --> 03:54.280
with you staying?

77
03:54.280 --> 03:55.520
It snows here!

78
03:55.870 --> 03:57.130
I have to go back south.

79
03:57.520 --> 03:58.120
Oh, right.

80
03:58.800 --> 03:59.660
Now I remember.

81
04:01.030 --> 04:02.120
You were covering your eyes

82
04:02.120 --> 04:03.150
last time.

83
04:03.190 --> 04:04.590
So you're afraid of snow.

84
04:07.360 --> 04:08.160
That's right.

85
04:08.840 --> 04:10.080
I grew up in the Northeast.

86
04:10.080 --> 04:11.630
Whenever it snowed in winter,

87
04:11.630 --> 04:13.160
I couldn't even go outside.

88
04:15.400 --> 04:16.329
Liu Zhengliang,

89
04:17.160 --> 04:18.360
you're not making this up, are you?

90
04:18.360 --> 04:19.600
I swear I'm not.

91
04:19.950 --> 04:21.480
Because of this condition,

92
04:24.560 --> 04:26.040
my mom sent me away

93
04:26.360 --> 04:27.360
when I was little.

94
04:39.070 --> 04:39.670
All right.

95
04:40.630 --> 04:41.680
I buy it.

96
04:45.720 --> 04:46.390
Thanks.

97
04:49.000 --> 04:49.630
Your condition

98
04:49.630 --> 04:51.290
is the mildest I've ever seen.

99
04:51.600 --> 04:53.000
Now I've got something else

100
04:53.000 --> 04:54.060
to use against you.

101
05:09.630 --> 05:10.630
Darn it.

102
05:11.340 --> 05:13.460
[Outpatient Clinic]

103
05:14.560 --> 05:15.160
Right.

104
05:15.160 --> 05:16.190
Who's this?

105
05:16.800 --> 05:17.920
This is a senior official from the Health Commission,

106
05:17.920 --> 05:18.310
Junnan!

107
05:18.310 --> 05:19.600
Nice to see you!

108
05:19.600 --> 05:20.070
Come on, this way.

109
05:20.070 --> 05:21.120
I reckon Dr. Chen

110
05:21.120 --> 05:23.050
will be Director Chen before long.

111
05:23.720 --> 05:25.240
He was just born lucky.

112
05:26.120 --> 05:27.630
A promising young man indeed.

113
05:27.630 --> 05:29.510
I'm quite envious.

114
05:31.680 --> 05:33.000
All right, Director Liu.

115
05:33.000 --> 05:33.720
Thank you.

116
05:33.720 --> 05:35.070
You came all this way in person.

117
05:35.070 --> 05:36.040
Thank you so much.

118
05:36.040 --> 05:36.480
All right.

119
05:36.480 --> 05:37.070
Okay.

120
05:37.070 --> 05:37.800
Take care.

121
05:37.800 --> 05:38.600
This way.

122
05:38.720 --> 05:40.920
We look forward to your guidance again.

123
05:42.240 --> 05:43.240
This way, please.

124
05:46.000 --> 05:46.720
What brings you here?

125
05:46.720 --> 05:47.580
I'm in trouble.

126
05:47.830 --> 05:48.510
What happened?

127
05:48.510 --> 05:50.240
You can't go even after you pay?

128
05:50.630 --> 05:52.290
They've taken a liking to you.

129
05:52.870 --> 05:53.600
Back then,

130
05:53.600 --> 05:54.870
I shouldn't have saved him.

131
05:54.870 --> 05:56.800
I should've let you just trach him.

132
05:57.000 --> 05:57.680
He'd probably still

133
05:57.680 --> 05:58.940
be at home recovering.

134
05:59.000 --> 06:00.390
That's not fair.

135
06:00.600 --> 06:02.190
Watch what you say.

136
06:02.510 --> 06:04.480
If you leave, what about Zhengguang?

137
06:04.480 --> 06:05.510
People in small towns

138
06:05.510 --> 06:06.480
are hopeless.

139
06:06.720 --> 06:08.480
They don't honor contracts at all.

140
06:08.480 --> 06:09.360
Now they're openly reneging.

141
06:09.360 --> 06:10.950
People in small towns?

142
06:10.970 --> 06:12.100
[Kindly close the door behind you]

143
06:12.920 --> 06:14.190
You're the one backing out.

144
06:14.190 --> 06:14.680
Besides,

145
06:14.680 --> 06:16.040
aren't you from a small town too?

146
06:16.040 --> 06:17.950
No, I'm from Shenzhen.

147
06:18.510 --> 06:19.360
That's why I can't get used

148
06:19.360 --> 06:20.690
to how things work here.

149
06:20.720 --> 06:21.240
Come on.

150
06:21.560 --> 06:23.830
Picking up a few Cantonese phrases,

151
06:24.070 --> 06:26.330
and you think you're a Guangdong native?

152
06:26.750 --> 06:28.550
You've barely been back a while,

153
06:30.560 --> 06:31.270
and your Northeastern accent

154
06:31.270 --> 06:32.600
is already coming back.

155
06:32.630 --> 06:33.510
Who says so?

156
06:33.720 --> 06:34.720
I don't have an accent.

157
06:34.720 --> 06:36.250
I speak standard Mandarin.

158
06:38.680 --> 06:40.040
Look at your accent.

159
06:40.040 --> 06:41.560
I don't have one.

160
06:41.800 --> 06:42.750
It's all your fault.

161
06:42.750 --> 06:43.750
Could you please speak

162
06:43.750 --> 06:44.830
standard Mandarin?

163
06:44.830 --> 06:46.159
It's all my fault?

164
06:46.270 --> 06:48.120
Next time I talk to you,

165
06:48.800 --> 06:50.000
I'll speak Mandarin.

166
06:51.510 --> 06:52.270
No way.

167
06:52.750 --> 06:54.750
I need to find a way out of here, fast.

168
06:55.430 --> 06:56.480
He even told me

169
06:56.480 --> 06:57.120
I'm the least sick person

170
06:57.120 --> 06:58.520
they've ever seen there.

171
07:00.160 --> 07:01.430
Do you think

172
07:01.800 --> 07:03.480
he's got some kind of weird fetish?

173
07:03.480 --> 07:04.870
I know Xiaoximen Hospital.

174
07:04.870 --> 07:06.270
They're short-staffed.

175
07:06.310 --> 07:07.190
He must think

176
07:07.190 --> 07:08.520
you're good at your job.

177
07:10.190 --> 07:11.190
That makes sense.

178
07:11.190 --> 07:11.870
Go on.

179
07:12.190 --> 07:13.070
If you really want out,

180
07:13.070 --> 07:14.070
I've got an idea.

181
07:15.310 --> 07:16.720
Why not just coast

182
07:16.830 --> 07:18.160
and do the bare minimum?

183
07:18.360 --> 07:19.190
You mean

184
07:19.190 --> 07:20.270
I should act incompetent

185
07:20.270 --> 07:21.480
until he fires me?

186
07:22.270 --> 07:23.070
Exactly.

187
07:25.040 --> 07:27.240
But I don't know how to act incompetent.

188
07:27.390 --> 07:28.920
It's hard to fake being a genius,

189
07:28.920 --> 07:30.630
but acting useless is easy.

190
07:31.230 --> 07:34.590
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

191
07:33.360 --> 07:34.240
Hey, Jia.

192
07:34.800 --> 07:35.560
Could you check

193
07:35.560 --> 07:36.920
with the fire department again?

194
07:36.920 --> 07:38.070
They've confirmed

195
07:38.070 --> 07:40.480
your mom isn't at that spot in the water.

196
07:40.480 --> 07:42.409
More days of searching won't help.

197
07:43.430 --> 07:44.360
Could they search

198
07:44.360 --> 07:45.190
farther downstream

199
07:45.190 --> 07:46.600
along the riverbank?

200
07:46.630 --> 07:49.600
They say she's not in this stretch of river.

201
07:49.950 --> 07:50.870
What about the tributaries?

202
07:50.870 --> 07:52.120
They can't find her.

203
07:52.360 --> 07:54.680
Zhengguang, your brother is right.

204
07:54.870 --> 07:57.390
The current must've carried her away.

205
07:57.430 --> 07:59.310
Have you contacted anyone near the river mouth?

206
07:59.310 --> 08:00.630
I just can't give up.

207
08:00.750 --> 08:01.870
Isn't there anything else we can do?

208
08:01.870 --> 08:03.750
Just give it a little more time, okay?

209
08:03.750 --> 08:04.950
All right. Thanks.

210
08:04.950 --> 08:06.410
I'll see what else I can do.

211
08:12.040 --> 08:13.720
Come on, let's eat.

212
08:18.040 --> 08:19.000
When are you going back to Shenzhen?

213
08:19.000 --> 08:20.070
Not anytime soon.

214
08:20.240 --> 08:21.430
I have to stay in this dump

215
08:21.430 --> 08:22.070
and work.

216
08:23.160 --> 08:24.240
Stay here and work?

217
08:24.480 --> 08:26.280
What about your job in Shenzhen?

218
08:27.430 --> 08:28.960
I don't work there anymore.

219
08:30.000 --> 08:31.630
Did you quit,

220
08:31.630 --> 08:33.120
or did they fire you?

221
08:33.960 --> 08:34.870
Stop prying.

222
08:35.390 --> 08:37.250
You wouldn't understand anyway.

223
08:37.360 --> 08:39.510
How is that prying?

224
08:40.080 --> 08:42.000
I bet you got fired.

225
08:43.200 --> 08:44.480
Let's be honest.

226
08:44.750 --> 08:46.120
With your personality,

227
08:46.630 --> 08:47.480
they were already being nice

228
08:47.480 --> 08:48.360
to keep you around

229
08:48.360 --> 08:50.030
for as long as they did.

230
08:50.750 --> 08:52.600
If this hospital won't keep you either,

231
08:52.600 --> 08:53.550
come with me.

232
08:55.030 --> 08:55.790
Take care.

233
08:55.790 --> 08:57.190
We'll sell funeral urns.

234
09:01.120 --> 09:01.840
Didn't you tell me

235
09:01.840 --> 09:03.700
you worked for a foreign company?

236
09:04.200 --> 09:05.080
Who said that?

237
09:06.320 --> 09:07.510
You did.

238
09:08.080 --> 09:09.200
The Dragon Boat Festival three years ago.

239
09:09.200 --> 09:12.000
I don't remember. I must've been messing with you.

240
09:12.000 --> 09:12.750
Besides,

241
09:12.750 --> 09:13.390
what foreign company

242
09:13.390 --> 09:15.030
would hire a low-education guy like me?

243
09:15.030 --> 09:15.750
Actually,

244
09:15.960 --> 09:16.840
I should ask:

245
09:16.910 --> 09:19.390
what foreign companies are there around here?

246
09:19.390 --> 09:21.480
You didn't really believe me, did you?

247
09:21.480 --> 09:22.150
Haven't you met

248
09:22.150 --> 09:23.680
my boss at the funeral home?

249
09:24.150 --> 09:24.910
Who?

250
09:26.030 --> 09:27.080
Ms. Aichen,

251
09:27.390 --> 09:29.720
the pretty, skinny lady,

252
09:29.720 --> 09:30.360
remember?

253
09:30.630 --> 09:31.510
Her?

254
09:31.510 --> 09:32.840
I thought she was your superior.

255
09:32.840 --> 09:34.080
Eat it while it's warm.

256
09:34.080 --> 09:35.140
She is my superior.

257
09:35.790 --> 09:37.590
But we're not a foreign company.

258
09:39.240 --> 09:40.640
It's a funeral business.

259
09:41.150 --> 09:42.680
A funeral service company.

260
09:42.790 --> 09:43.750
She gets up early every day

261
09:43.750 --> 09:45.410
and keeps a regular schedule.

262
09:50.790 --> 09:51.650
How about this?

263
09:52.120 --> 09:53.150
Once you're discharged,

264
09:53.150 --> 09:54.390
I'll help you find

265
09:54.550 --> 09:55.360
another job.

266
09:56.150 --> 09:56.910
Why?

267
09:57.510 --> 09:58.640
I'm doing just fine.

268
10:02.270 --> 10:03.470
Mom said in her letter

269
10:03.870 --> 10:04.930
to take care of you.

270
10:07.360 --> 10:08.390
What Mom meant was,

271
10:08.390 --> 10:09.390
maybe she wanted us

272
10:09.390 --> 10:11.550
to take care of each other.

273
10:14.150 --> 10:15.390
I mean,

274
10:15.550 --> 10:16.480
you should find

275
10:16.480 --> 10:17.480
a more respectable job.

276
10:17.480 --> 10:19.080
I'm only looking out for you.

277
10:20.120 --> 10:21.720
There's a flaw in your logic.

278
10:21.790 --> 10:23.440
What's wrong with my job?

279
10:23.790 --> 10:25.270
Everyone dies someday.

280
10:25.440 --> 10:27.440
And then they need a box to go in.

281
10:28.360 --> 10:28.870
Let me tell you,

282
10:28.870 --> 10:30.530
you'd better be nice to me now.

283
10:30.630 --> 10:32.430
When your time comes,

284
10:32.430 --> 10:33.440
I might be kind enough

285
10:33.440 --> 10:34.670
to find you a nice spot.

286
10:34.670 --> 10:35.600
Liu Zhengguang!

287
10:36.480 --> 10:37.960
Don't joke about that.

288
10:38.270 --> 10:40.530
Doctors can't stand hearing that stuff.

289
10:41.750 --> 10:43.280
What's wrong with doctors?

290
10:43.600 --> 10:44.480
I bet you don't even make

291
10:44.480 --> 10:45.790
as much as Ms. Aichen.

292
10:46.120 --> 10:47.720
We're nothing alike.

293
10:47.750 --> 10:49.610
Making money off dying patients?

294
10:49.960 --> 10:51.760
No amount of money is worth that.

295
10:58.910 --> 10:59.840
Liu Zhengliang.

296
11:01.870 --> 11:02.750
Bro.

297
11:04.720 --> 11:05.550
What's up?

298
11:06.840 --> 11:08.270
Can we talk like normal people?

299
11:08.270 --> 11:09.030
Fine.

300
11:10.000 --> 11:11.360
I do want to change jobs,

301
11:11.720 --> 11:13.120
but Aichen's parents

302
11:13.120 --> 11:14.520
are old friends of Mom's.

303
11:14.790 --> 11:16.070
Uncle Ai and Aunt Mi.

304
11:16.070 --> 11:17.270
Do you remember them?

305
11:18.720 --> 11:20.980
Mom mentioned them. I vaguely remember.

306
11:21.200 --> 11:22.510
With that connection,

307
11:22.720 --> 11:24.580
I can't just tell her I'm leaving.

308
11:24.600 --> 11:26.000
What's so hard about that?

309
11:26.000 --> 11:27.330
Just tell her straight.

310
11:29.960 --> 11:31.560
Why don't you tell her for me?

311
11:34.080 --> 11:35.670
Why should I do that?

312
11:37.750 --> 11:39.510
Are you scared of her?

313
11:40.080 --> 11:41.080
Too chicken to go?

314
11:48.550 --> 11:49.600
Give me the address.

315
11:49.600 --> 11:56.390
"Dad, tomorrow you'll ride off to the West.

316
11:49.760 --> 11:52.250
[Fucheng Funeral Services Street]

317
11:52.410 --> 11:55.550
[Xiao'an Paper Offerings Shop]

318
11:56.790 --> 12:01.870
Your child bows before you.

319
12:02.600 --> 12:06.150
Calling out, 'Dad!'

320
12:06.240 --> 12:09.840
Crying, 'Oh, Dad!'

321
12:10.120 --> 12:20.390
Dad, take it slow on your way tomorrow!"

322
12:27.240 --> 12:28.000
Hey, girl,

323
12:28.670 --> 12:30.530
getting the hang of the business?

324
12:31.600 --> 12:33.200
You know, in our line of work,

325
12:33.200 --> 12:35.000
nothing should be taboo.

326
12:36.790 --> 12:39.550
But next time you cry,

327
12:39.550 --> 12:41.080
don't cry for your dad.

328
12:42.120 --> 12:43.050
Cry for your mom.

329
12:43.120 --> 12:44.360
No, I mean...

330
12:45.630 --> 12:46.830
Cry for your grandpa.

331
12:49.030 --> 12:50.670
Sorry about that, Third Brother.

332
12:50.670 --> 12:52.550
I'll change it right away.

333
13:24.390 --> 13:26.480
One-three-one-four.

334
13:26.480 --> 13:28.140
Right, one-three-one-four.

335
13:28.910 --> 13:30.120
One-three-one-four.

336
13:30.120 --> 13:31.050
That works, too.

337
13:32.360 --> 13:33.620
One-three-one-four.

338
13:34.870 --> 13:36.130
One-three-one-four.

339
13:39.910 --> 13:41.240
Something's not right.

340
13:41.240 --> 13:42.120
What's wrong?

341
13:44.150 --> 13:46.030
I entered the Morse code for 1314,

342
13:46.240 --> 13:48.030
but the message didn't get through.

343
13:48.030 --> 13:48.550
This...

344
13:54.960 --> 13:56.480
No wonder they leave here

345
13:56.480 --> 13:57.360
in tears.

346
13:57.840 --> 13:59.150
Did the mission fail?

347
14:01.320 --> 14:02.550
No, you... you're...

348
14:02.550 --> 14:03.360
Chief,

349
14:03.440 --> 14:04.770
don't you recognize me?

350
14:06.360 --> 14:07.360
Comrade Xiaobo sent me

351
14:07.360 --> 14:08.550
to be your adjutant.

352
14:08.600 --> 14:09.910
Who's Xiaobo?

353
14:10.240 --> 14:11.440
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

354
14:11.440 --> 14:12.440
That's protocol.

355
14:13.000 --> 14:14.000
He's my superior.

356
14:16.440 --> 14:17.640
Did the mission fail?

357
14:18.240 --> 14:18.840
Comrade,

358
14:19.440 --> 14:20.970
the mission hasn't failed.

359
14:21.750 --> 14:23.150
The organization wants you

360
14:23.150 --> 14:25.120
to take care of yourself

361
14:25.600 --> 14:27.200
and await your next mission.

362
14:28.240 --> 14:29.270
The organization hasn't forgotten me?

363
14:29.270 --> 14:30.240
Of course not.

364
14:30.750 --> 14:32.180
I promise I'll complete the mission.

365
14:32.180 --> 14:36.230
[1314 Funeral Services]

366
14:32.240 --> 14:33.440
Rest assured, Chief.

367
14:34.390 --> 14:35.440
You all take care.

368
14:35.440 --> 14:36.390
Stay alert.

369
14:36.840 --> 14:37.440
All right.

370
14:37.790 --> 14:38.510
Take care.

371
14:39.750 --> 14:40.440
Keep a low profile.

372
14:40.440 --> 14:41.240
Don't worry.

373
14:43.080 --> 14:44.340
Don't worry, Comrade.

374
14:52.200 --> 14:53.360
Where have you been?

375
14:53.360 --> 14:55.160
You wouldn't answer your phone.

376
14:56.000 --> 14:57.390
This is for the secret rendezvous.

377
14:57.390 --> 14:58.510
What's this thing?

378
14:59.750 --> 15:00.320
Sis...

379
15:00.750 --> 15:01.510
He's a lunatic.

380
15:01.510 --> 15:03.000
Can't you give me a break?

381
15:03.480 --> 15:04.790
- You even played along. - Look at you,

382
15:04.790 --> 15:06.390
you're only getting fatter and dumber.

383
15:06.390 --> 15:07.150
Didn't you notice

384
15:07.150 --> 15:08.320
how neat and tidy he was,

385
15:08.320 --> 15:09.600
how clean he looked?

386
15:09.600 --> 15:10.390
So what does that prove?

387
15:10.390 --> 15:11.600
That he just got sick.

388
15:12.120 --> 15:13.600
It proves someone's looking after him,

389
15:13.600 --> 15:14.360
you know?

390
15:14.550 --> 15:15.240
People like him

391
15:15.240 --> 15:16.840
won't hurt anyone.

392
15:17.000 --> 15:17.960
I don't buy it.

393
15:18.240 --> 15:19.240
If someone's looking after him,

394
15:19.240 --> 15:21.040
why let him wander around alone?

395
15:21.360 --> 15:22.840
What's all that noise?

396
15:32.510 --> 15:33.840
Is that a marching band?

397
15:34.150 --> 15:35.510
Must be that new-style funeral crew

398
15:35.510 --> 15:36.670
that just popped up.

399
15:37.120 --> 15:39.120
They're ridiculously over the top.

400
15:39.200 --> 15:40.120
They even offer

401
15:40.120 --> 15:41.840
spa treatments for the dead.

402
15:42.150 --> 15:43.360
New-style?

403
15:44.320 --> 15:45.480
Who's behind it?

404
15:45.510 --> 15:46.670
A local.

405
15:46.840 --> 15:48.550
I hear they studied abroad.

406
15:46.920 --> 15:48.940
[Daxi Fried Snacks]

407
15:49.120 --> 15:50.390
They don't play fair.

408
15:50.630 --> 15:51.910
They've got people in every hospital

409
15:51.910 --> 15:53.030
stealing our business.

410
15:53.030 --> 15:54.000
How dare they!

411
16:05.510 --> 16:06.840
What are you doing here?

412
16:09.080 --> 16:10.210
Let's talk outside.

413
16:14.240 --> 16:15.170
What's going on?

414
16:16.320 --> 16:18.520
Has Zhengguang's condition worsened?

415
16:18.600 --> 16:19.390
No.

416
16:20.120 --> 16:21.520
I just need to talk to you.

417
16:22.150 --> 16:23.810
What do you want to talk about?

418
16:27.120 --> 16:28.480
They're dating?

419
16:29.390 --> 16:30.600
I didn't know, Dad.

420
16:30.790 --> 16:32.390
What a brave soul.

421
16:33.630 --> 16:36.430
That brave soul looks like Zhengguang's brother.

422
16:37.510 --> 16:38.000
Hello?

423
16:38.000 --> 16:38.960
Where are you?

424
16:40.240 --> 16:41.790
Why hasn't anyone come to pick me up?

425
16:41.790 --> 16:43.080
Isn't it next month?

426
16:43.480 --> 16:44.630
I want to talk to you

427
16:44.630 --> 16:45.870
about Liu Zhengguang's future

428
16:45.870 --> 16:47.400
and his big life decisions.

429
16:48.270 --> 16:49.510
Well...

430
16:50.120 --> 16:50.870
Not a chance.

431
16:51.440 --> 16:53.370
I'm not interested in younger men.

432
16:55.000 --> 16:55.670
No.

433
16:55.670 --> 16:56.360
Aichen,

434
16:56.360 --> 16:57.200
your mom's here.

435
16:57.200 --> 16:58.000
Go get her.

436
16:59.270 --> 17:00.120
I'm getting Mom!

437
17:00.120 --> 17:01.320
Hurry! Move!

438
17:04.270 --> 17:05.510
Sis, wait for me!

439
17:11.740 --> 17:15.450
[Prison]

440
17:27.750 --> 17:28.720
Mom!

441
17:29.350 --> 17:30.830
I've missed you so much!

442
17:33.960 --> 17:35.000
Your poor little face is freezing.

443
17:35.000 --> 17:36.200
Here, put this on.

444
17:36.790 --> 17:37.350
Let's go home.

445
17:37.350 --> 17:37.810
Come on.

446
17:38.110 --> 17:39.110
We're going home.

447
17:44.800 --> 17:49.660
[1314 Funeral Services]

448
17:52.480 --> 17:53.610
Come sit in the back.

449
18:15.920 --> 18:17.400
Did you deliberately get the time wrong

450
18:17.400 --> 18:18.590
because you didn't want to pick me up?

451
18:18.590 --> 18:19.520
Absolutely not.

452
18:21.030 --> 18:21.750
Sit closer.

453
18:23.270 --> 18:25.110
Amy, I'm sorry.

454
18:25.310 --> 18:26.440
What did you call me?

455
18:26.480 --> 18:27.960
Who are you talking to?

456
18:28.240 --> 18:30.200
I gave your mom a new name:

457
18:30.720 --> 18:34.310
Ai San Loves Mi Si the Most.

458
18:35.110 --> 18:35.830
That's too long,

459
18:35.830 --> 18:38.480
so I shortened it to Amy.

460
18:38.060 --> 18:40.940
[1314 Funeral Services]

461
18:39.310 --> 18:39.920
Come here.

462
18:40.920 --> 18:42.680
Amy, I'm sorry.

463
18:46.960 --> 18:49.680
Long live freedom!

464
18:49.880 --> 18:51.240
"We're different.

465
18:51.240 --> 18:53.440
Different, different..."

466
18:55.310 --> 18:57.140
[Fucheng Huaide Funeral Center]

467
18:57.180 --> 19:01.400
[1314 Funeral Services]

468
18:57.720 --> 18:58.920
I'll go open the door.

469
18:59.790 --> 19:01.880
Street music and square dancing.

470
19:02.110 --> 19:04.000
They're all Northeastern songs.

471
19:05.200 --> 19:06.510
Why are you still here?

472
19:06.750 --> 19:07.790
I was waiting for you,

473
19:07.530 --> 19:10.910
[Complete Funeral Services]

474
19:08.160 --> 19:10.020
who ran off before I could finish.

475
19:10.350 --> 19:11.440
You're unbelievable.

476
19:11.440 --> 19:13.510
It's a two-hour round trip for us.

477
19:13.510 --> 19:14.240
Come on.

478
19:14.240 --> 19:15.350
Let's talk inside.

479
19:15.590 --> 19:16.640
No, let's talk here.

480
19:16.640 --> 19:17.750
I'll be quick.

481
19:18.160 --> 19:19.020
The thing is...

482
19:19.830 --> 19:20.880
Who's this young man?

483
19:20.880 --> 19:22.210
Zhengguang's brother.

484
19:26.960 --> 19:29.020
The doctor who came up from the South.

485
19:29.680 --> 19:31.880
He's better-looking than Zhengguang.

486
19:33.960 --> 19:35.240
Let's talk inside.

487
19:35.310 --> 19:35.880
No need.

488
19:38.110 --> 19:40.110
I'll get you a chair, then.

489
19:40.110 --> 19:40.590
No need.

490
19:44.160 --> 19:46.000
I'll get you something to drink.

491
19:46.000 --> 19:46.680
No need.

492
19:52.590 --> 19:53.920
Take your time talking.

493
19:54.310 --> 19:55.590
I'll get straight to the point.

494
19:55.590 --> 19:56.550
I'm here on Liu Zhengguang's behalf

495
19:56.550 --> 19:57.400
to let you know

496
19:57.400 --> 19:58.200
that once he's discharged,

497
19:58.200 --> 19:59.310
he won't be working for you anymore.

498
19:59.310 --> 20:00.110
Why not?

499
20:01.880 --> 20:03.480
He wants a different job.

500
20:04.750 --> 20:05.750
What kind of job?

501
20:06.110 --> 20:07.070
He hasn't decided yet,

502
20:07.070 --> 20:08.870
but this one isn't right for him.

503
20:09.350 --> 20:10.960
Is that what you think,

504
20:10.960 --> 20:12.110
or does he think so?

505
20:13.680 --> 20:15.590
He wants a change.

506
20:15.790 --> 20:16.400
Of course,

507
20:16.400 --> 20:17.440
I agree with him too.

508
20:17.440 --> 20:18.240
Get lost!

509
20:18.880 --> 20:20.310
Putting on an act, huh?

510
20:20.720 --> 20:21.160
Just now,

511
20:21.160 --> 20:22.720
you were too cool to talk, huh?

512
20:22.720 --> 20:24.640
That's my dad, got it?

513
20:25.310 --> 20:26.960
Wasn't he welcoming enough?

514
20:28.270 --> 20:29.310
You're something else.

515
20:29.310 --> 20:31.170
You wouldn't even give him a look.

516
20:31.680 --> 20:33.010
Who do you think you are?

517
20:33.200 --> 20:34.790
Standing there,

518
20:34.790 --> 20:35.590
like a telephone pole

519
20:35.590 --> 20:36.880
with extra ears.

520
20:37.200 --> 20:38.750
You shouldn't be called Zhengliang.

521
20:38.750 --> 20:40.150
You're "Pole with Ears."

522
20:40.720 --> 20:42.050
What are you staring at?

523
20:42.790 --> 20:43.960
You look down on funeral workers,

524
20:43.960 --> 20:44.560
don't you?

525
20:45.440 --> 20:47.110
Sis!

526
20:47.440 --> 20:47.880
There's a man at First Hospital

527
20:47.880 --> 20:48.590
who's on his last legs.

528
20:48.590 --> 20:49.320
Are we going?

529
20:52.920 --> 20:54.110
I-I don't care!

530
20:54.510 --> 20:56.400
I don't care what line of work you're in.

531
20:56.400 --> 20:56.960
But my brother

532
20:56.960 --> 20:58.200
won't be working for you anymore.

533
20:58.200 --> 20:59.070
I hope you understand.

534
20:59.070 --> 21:00.130
Understand my ass!

535
21:00.480 --> 21:01.940
Did you come to make a wish?

536
21:03.310 --> 21:05.480
Such foul language. No class at all.

537
21:07.110 --> 21:08.160
Let me show you

538
21:08.270 --> 21:10.510
a failure of character education.

539
21:11.900 --> 21:13.110
[Complete Funeral Services]

540
21:12.160 --> 21:13.620
I'm not finished talking!

541
21:14.310 --> 21:15.310
I don't care!

542
21:15.680 --> 21:17.070
I don't care if you agree or not.

543
21:17.070 --> 21:18.400
Once Liu Zhengguang is discharged,

544
21:18.400 --> 21:19.440
he's done working here.

545
21:19.440 --> 21:20.270
Got it?

546
21:21.270 --> 21:21.920
Wait.

547
21:24.030 --> 21:25.360
What are you getting at?

548
21:27.350 --> 21:28.960
We live under the rule of law,

549
21:28.960 --> 21:30.070
in broad daylight.

550
21:30.310 --> 21:31.640
Who are you trying to scare?

551
21:31.640 --> 21:33.440
Come on, hit me here.

552
21:33.440 --> 21:34.480
Go ahead, try it.

553
21:34.480 --> 21:35.640
Fine, I'll do it!

554
21:35.640 --> 21:36.350
So what?

555
21:37.270 --> 21:37.750
Hey!

556
21:37.750 --> 21:38.310
Shouting at me, huh?

557
21:38.310 --> 21:39.480
Wait!

558
21:39.480 --> 21:40.480
Hold on!

559
21:40.480 --> 21:41.810
I-I'll call the police!

560
21:43.550 --> 21:43.920
I'm telling you,

561
21:43.920 --> 21:45.650
I'll call the police right now!

562
21:46.720 --> 21:48.380
You wanna pick a fight with me?

563
21:56.480 --> 21:57.590
Just you wait!

564
21:57.790 --> 21:59.190
I'll beat you senseless!

565
22:01.450 --> 22:04.040
[Xiaoximen Hospital] [Starry Night]

566
22:10.810 --> 22:11.920
[Surgical Inpatient Department]

567
22:12.960 --> 22:14.160
What's wrong, bro?

568
22:14.350 --> 22:15.550
Did you get beaten up?

569
22:15.960 --> 22:17.270
Just your bad luck.

570
22:17.720 --> 22:19.680
I knew you'd get your ass kicked.

571
22:23.350 --> 22:24.350
Mom said

572
22:24.350 --> 22:25.810
you have to take care of me.

573
22:33.920 --> 22:35.050
Some doctor you are.

574
22:35.430 --> 22:38.070
[ICU is on Floor 2]

575
22:58.550 --> 22:59.680
Who are you here to see?

576
22:59.680 --> 23:01.680
I'm here to report to Director Tong.

577
23:03.110 --> 23:04.270
He's not here right now.

578
23:04.270 --> 23:05.550
You can tell me what you need.

579
23:05.550 --> 23:06.210
That works.

580
23:06.880 --> 23:07.830
And you are?

581
23:09.400 --> 23:10.720
I'm Song Jian.

582
23:10.720 --> 23:11.960
Just call me Dr. Song.

583
23:14.030 --> 23:14.880
Dr. Song.

584
23:16.680 --> 23:17.590
How many years?

585
23:19.000 --> 23:20.200
How'd you end up here?

586
23:20.440 --> 23:21.640
You mean my contract?

587
23:23.200 --> 23:24.590
The president tricked me

588
23:24.590 --> 23:26.120
into signing a 5-year deal.

589
23:27.750 --> 23:29.240
Now you're talking.

590
23:30.030 --> 23:32.750
This place is nothing but a scam.

591
23:33.270 --> 23:34.350
Look at me.

592
23:34.750 --> 23:36.240
Fifteen years.

593
23:36.350 --> 23:37.680
Fifteen years?

594
23:37.680 --> 23:38.550
You bet.

595
23:38.550 --> 23:39.750
They tricked you too?

596
23:41.590 --> 23:42.720
-Song Jian. -So, I'm telling you about this place...

597
23:42.720 --> 23:43.350
What are you doing here?

598
23:43.350 --> 23:43.920
Listen to me.

599
23:43.920 --> 23:45.160
-Where’s your family? -Go! Go!

600
23:45.160 --> 23:45.720
Let's go.

601
23:45.720 --> 23:46.640
What are you doing?

602
23:46.640 --> 23:47.920
I'm just chatting with my buddy.

603
23:47.920 --> 23:48.680
How rude.

604
23:48.790 --> 23:50.960
Come on, have a seat, buddy.

605
23:51.400 --> 23:52.160
Sorry about that.

606
23:52.160 --> 23:53.000
This patient was just released from prison.

607
23:53.000 --> 23:53.750
He's got some mental issues.

608
23:53.750 --> 23:54.480
The big hospitals wouldn't take him,

609
23:54.480 --> 23:55.640
so they sent him here.

610
23:55.640 --> 23:56.840
What are you here for?

611
23:58.480 --> 23:59.920
I... I'm here to report to Director Tong.

612
23:59.920 --> 24:00.960
He's next door.

613
24:11.430 --> 24:13.500
[Director's Office]

614
24:17.240 --> 24:17.960
Come in.

615
24:18.430 --> 24:26.090
[Hot Water: Handle with Care to Avoid Scalding]

616
24:19.400 --> 24:21.110
Hello, Director Tong.

617
24:21.110 --> 24:22.640
I'm here to report for duty.

618
24:22.680 --> 24:23.340
Have a seat.

619
24:23.550 --> 24:24.880
Liu Zhengliang, right?

620
24:30.350 --> 24:31.440
To be honest,

621
24:33.030 --> 24:34.070
I'm not too keen on you

622
24:34.070 --> 24:35.330
joining our hospital.

623
24:35.480 --> 24:37.310
After all, you came back from a big city.

624
24:37.310 --> 24:39.200
I don't think you'll fit in

625
24:39.200 --> 24:40.750
with the way things work here.

626
24:40.750 --> 24:41.590
I think you're

627
24:41.590 --> 24:42.680
absolutely right.

628
24:43.440 --> 24:44.440
Right about what?

629
24:46.160 --> 24:48.000
I owe you an apology

630
24:49.070 --> 24:50.400
for what I said earlier.

631
24:50.750 --> 24:51.350
The reason

632
24:51.350 --> 24:53.110
I had those thoughts before

633
24:54.160 --> 24:55.720
was that I had a narrow outlook.

634
24:55.720 --> 24:57.520
But the president is different.

635
24:58.030 --> 24:59.640
He's a man of vision.

636
25:00.640 --> 25:01.440
He said,

637
25:02.830 --> 25:05.790
"A doctor is like a pair of chopsticks. Long or short, both come in handy.

638
25:05.790 --> 25:07.990
Treating patients is like fixing cars.

639
25:08.000 --> 25:09.070
No matter the size of the wrench,

640
25:09.070 --> 25:11.270
if it can turn a screw, it's a good tool."

641
25:11.400 --> 25:13.000
Now that's real wisdom.

642
25:14.350 --> 25:16.070
It really opens your eyes.

643
25:16.480 --> 25:19.010
I don't think that's quite appropriate here.

644
25:20.350 --> 25:21.240
When the president speaks,

645
25:21.240 --> 25:22.590
you just listen.

646
25:24.640 --> 25:26.240
And listening isn't enough.

647
25:27.160 --> 25:28.560
You have to think it over.

648
25:28.590 --> 25:29.520
Savor his words.

649
25:33.640 --> 25:35.040
You've got a lot to learn.

650
25:56.720 --> 25:57.320
By the way,

651
25:59.830 --> 26:00.880
our Neurosurgical Department

652
26:00.880 --> 26:02.640
hardly has any patients.

653
26:03.640 --> 26:06.040
We almost have more doctors than patients.

654
26:06.480 --> 26:08.240
As for the rules at Xiaoximen,

655
26:08.240 --> 26:10.030
emergency surgery duty rotates

656
26:10.030 --> 26:12.790
among the surgical departments.

657
26:12.880 --> 26:14.480
This quarter, it's our turn.

658
26:14.680 --> 26:15.510
Che Mingming,

659
26:15.640 --> 26:16.920
the doctor

660
26:16.920 --> 26:18.590
who assisted you that day,

661
26:18.590 --> 26:19.960
has already reported for duty.

662
26:19.960 --> 26:21.760
Go straight to the ER and see her.

663
26:23.680 --> 26:24.540
One more thing.

664
26:24.880 --> 26:26.440
You still have to keep up with

665
26:26.440 --> 26:28.440
your department's regular duties.

666
26:28.720 --> 26:29.480
Right now, you only have

667
26:29.480 --> 26:30.960
your brother as a patient,

668
26:31.070 --> 26:32.670
so you've got it pretty easy.

669
26:50.380 --> 26:52.770
[For comedic effect only. Please follow your doctor's instructions] [Metronidazole Tablets]

670
26:50.480 --> 26:51.550
Don't get the wrong idea.

671
26:51.550 --> 26:52.790
This is metronidazole.

672
26:52.790 --> 26:59.190
[For comedic effect only. Please follow your doctor's instructions]

673
26:55.400 --> 26:57.000
The president's sister-in-law told me

674
26:57.000 --> 26:58.270
that if you crush it up

675
26:58.270 --> 27:00.200
and sniff it, it'll cure rhinitis.

676
27:04.160 --> 27:05.680
I go through so much tissue because of my rhinitis.

677
27:05.680 --> 27:06.590
I spend several bucks a day

678
27:06.590 --> 27:07.520
just on tissues.

679
27:08.350 --> 27:10.000
So it was metronidazole all along.

680
27:10.000 --> 27:10.720
Scared you, huh?

681
27:10.720 --> 27:11.920
I hate that stuff too.

682
27:14.200 --> 27:15.240
All right, Director.

683
27:15.240 --> 27:16.590
I'll head to the ER now.

684
27:16.920 --> 27:17.480
Go ahead.

685
27:22.400 --> 27:23.400
Wait a minute.

686
27:23.920 --> 27:25.270
Metronidazole for rhinitis?

687
27:25.270 --> 27:26.880
And you're applying it topically?

688
27:26.880 --> 27:28.830
Is there any scientific basis for that?

689
27:28.830 --> 27:30.000
Which hospital

690
27:30.000 --> 27:30.880
does the president's sister-in-law

691
27:30.880 --> 27:32.000
work at as an ENT specialist?

692
27:32.000 --> 27:33.030
What specialist?

693
27:33.550 --> 27:34.550
The president's sister-in-law

694
27:34.550 --> 27:36.270
is an accountant at Qiaoxi Elementary School.

695
27:36.270 --> 27:36.750
You...

696
27:37.400 --> 27:39.030
You're the director of Neurosurgical Department,

697
27:39.030 --> 27:40.480
and you're treating yourself with some folk remedy

698
27:40.480 --> 27:42.210
recommended by an accountant?

699
27:44.110 --> 27:45.200
The president's sister-in-law

700
27:45.200 --> 27:46.830
is no ordinary person.

701
27:48.960 --> 27:49.790
You might think

702
27:49.790 --> 27:51.250
I'm just sucking up to him,

703
27:51.550 --> 27:52.610
but I'm really not.

704
27:56.750 --> 27:58.920
You'll understand in time.

705
28:01.070 --> 28:02.270
Do you have rhinitis?

706
28:04.850 --> 28:08.010
[Accessible Route]

707
28:17.910 --> 28:22.340
[Hospital Admission Registration]

708
28:26.720 --> 28:27.510
Stop!

709
28:27.750 --> 28:31.270
-Bro, run! Why are you chasing me? -Song Jian! Stop!

710
28:31.440 --> 28:32.430
Song Jian, don't run!

711
28:32.430 --> 28:33.440
How rude.

712
28:34.350 --> 28:34.790
You...

713
28:36.830 --> 28:37.590
Waiter!

714
28:37.590 --> 28:39.000
Get me a pair of slippers.

715
28:39.160 --> 28:41.550
And open another bottle of 30-year-old Moutai.

716
28:41.550 --> 28:42.270
What's going on?

717
28:42.270 --> 28:44.470
He's messed up his brain from drinking.

718
29:14.510 --> 29:15.420
[Emergency Department]

719
29:35.320 --> 29:39.480
[Fucheng Bank]

720
29:53.110 --> 29:54.110
-The ER... -Doctor.

721
29:54.110 --> 29:54.830
Doctor.

722
29:54.130 --> 29:54.920
[Interpreting Treatise on the Spleen and Stomach Through Five Circuits and Six Qi]

723
29:55.070 --> 29:56.130
Take a look at this.

724
29:56.240 --> 29:57.750
There's something stuck in here.

725
29:57.750 --> 29:58.680
It hurts so much.

726
29:59.880 --> 30:01.160
If something's stuck between your teeth,

727
30:01.160 --> 30:02.350
just pick it out yourself.

728
30:02.350 --> 30:04.240
Doctor, how can you say that?

729
30:04.750 --> 30:06.110
If I could get it out myself at home,

730
30:06.110 --> 30:07.830
why would I come to a doctor?

731
30:07.960 --> 30:08.920
Am I right?

732
30:09.240 --> 30:10.270
Open your mouth.

733
30:12.680 --> 30:13.740
Come on, open wide.

734
30:14.310 --> 30:15.350
Come on, open up.

735
30:16.590 --> 30:17.400
Which tooth?

736
30:17.510 --> 30:18.400
This one at the bottom. This one.

737
30:18.400 --> 30:19.460
This one down here.

738
30:19.480 --> 30:20.240
Where? This side?

739
30:20.240 --> 30:20.880
This side.

740
30:22.680 --> 30:23.750
What's all the yelling for?

741
30:23.750 --> 30:24.350
Open your mouth.

742
30:24.350 --> 30:25.480
Easy, doctor! Easy!

743
30:26.350 --> 30:27.440
It's inflamed from whatever's stuck in there.

744
30:27.440 --> 30:28.110
A little.

745
30:28.680 --> 30:29.920
What kind of bone were you chewing on?

746
30:29.920 --> 30:30.720
Chicken bone.

747
30:30.920 --> 30:31.720
Chicken bone?

748
30:44.260 --> 30:51.850
[Doctor's Office]

749
30:45.310 --> 30:46.110
Come on.

750
30:46.480 --> 30:48.070
Are you really that desperate for money?

751
30:48.070 --> 30:49.790
Why go back to your old line of work?

752
30:49.790 --> 30:50.960
So what if I go back to my old line of work?

753
30:50.960 --> 30:52.350
How does that affect you?

754
30:52.350 --> 30:53.550
What business is it of yours?

755
30:53.550 --> 30:55.000
I'm free to do what I want.

756
30:55.070 --> 30:56.240
Aren't you afraid people will find out

757
30:56.240 --> 30:57.270
what you used to do?

758
30:57.270 --> 30:58.720
So what if I used to do that?

759
30:58.720 --> 30:59.750
You're so high and mighty.

760
30:59.750 --> 31:00.550
Fine, fine, fine.

761
31:00.550 --> 31:01.790
You're unbelievably shameless.

762
31:01.550 --> 31:02.760
[No Unauthorized Entry into Doctors' Lounge]

763
31:01.790 --> 31:02.720
I'm telling you.

764
31:20.480 --> 31:21.270
Hello.

765
31:21.510 --> 31:22.640
I'm...

766
31:24.240 --> 31:25.440
I know you.

767
31:25.750 --> 31:27.640
Liu Zhengliang, right?

768
31:28.480 --> 31:30.070
I heard this morning you were coming.

769
31:30.070 --> 31:31.000
Nice to meet you.

770
31:31.270 --> 31:32.150
I'm Zhang Hao.

771
31:32.350 --> 31:34.720
Call me Hao or Bro, whatever you like.

772
31:37.270 --> 31:38.000
Well...

773
31:38.000 --> 31:39.310
Come on, come inside.

774
31:39.310 --> 31:41.440
That break room is shared by everyone.

775
31:41.720 --> 31:43.960
If anyone needs a bed, ladies first.

776
31:44.750 --> 31:46.400
Take a look and choose whichever locker you like.

777
31:46.400 --> 31:47.260
Help yourself.

778
31:58.550 --> 31:59.510
Sorry, sorry.

779
31:59.510 --> 32:01.170
He's new here. He didn't know.

780
32:09.830 --> 32:11.160
Look at your luck.

781
32:11.550 --> 32:12.960
I had this spot divined especially.

782
32:12.960 --> 32:13.830
This is the wealth spot.

783
32:13.830 --> 32:14.720
Dr. Zhang!

784
32:15.000 --> 32:16.270
Dr. Zhang!

785
32:17.070 --> 32:17.830
It's not even noon,

786
32:17.830 --> 32:20.030
and you've already got drunk patients?

787
32:20.350 --> 32:21.440
They're two old guys

788
32:21.440 --> 32:22.790
who came in on a group deal early this morning.

789
32:22.790 --> 32:23.920
One was over there belting out songs,

790
32:23.920 --> 32:24.790
and the other changed the track,

791
32:24.790 --> 32:25.480
so they got into a fight.

792
32:25.480 --> 32:26.350
All right, got it.

793
32:26.350 --> 32:27.110
You got it?

794
32:27.110 --> 32:27.550
Okay.

795
32:27.550 --> 32:29.830
Dr. Che, a trauma case!

796
32:29.830 --> 32:31.030
Patch the patient up.

797
32:31.440 --> 32:33.000
Where does that door lead?

798
32:33.720 --> 32:34.750
The fast track,

799
32:34.750 --> 32:36.030
straight to the karaoke lounge.

800
32:36.030 --> 32:37.560
I'll show you to the office.

801
32:38.050 --> 32:38.890
[Doctor's Office]

802
32:55.400 --> 32:56.350
Sorry about that.

803
32:56.350 --> 32:57.830
I forgot you were behind me.

804
32:57.830 --> 32:59.830
How did you manage to open this door?

805
33:00.400 --> 33:02.070
It's been broken for two years.

806
33:02.070 --> 33:03.590
You have to find the right trick.

807
33:03.590 --> 33:04.880
Lift it up a little.

808
33:04.880 --> 33:06.070
Don't lift it too high.

809
33:06.070 --> 33:07.730
You have to get the feel for it.

810
33:08.000 --> 33:08.310
Then turn it, and it opens.

811
33:08.310 --> 33:09.160
Give it a try.

812
33:09.640 --> 33:10.480
Go on, try it.

813
33:17.270 --> 33:17.720
Fine.

814
33:19.110 --> 33:20.830
Why don't you fix the door?

815
33:20.830 --> 33:21.030
What's the point?

816
33:21.030 --> 33:22.000
Oh my god.

817
33:22.000 --> 33:22.440
What's the point?

818
33:22.440 --> 33:24.000
Everyone likes it this way.

819
33:24.110 --> 33:25.200
We don't have to lock the door anymore.

820
33:25.200 --> 33:26.160
Outsiders can't open it,

821
33:26.160 --> 33:28.200
but we can with a simple twist.

822
33:28.270 --> 33:30.030
It's even better than a fingerprint lock.

823
33:30.030 --> 33:30.680
Some departments

824
33:30.680 --> 33:32.310
have actually tried to make their doors work like this.

825
33:32.310 --> 33:33.200
They studied it for ages

826
33:33.200 --> 33:34.830
and still couldn't figure out how it works.

827
33:34.830 --> 33:35.920
Come in, please.

828
33:37.640 --> 33:39.500
You can try figuring it out later.

829
33:40.310 --> 33:41.400
This is the shift handover room.

830
33:41.400 --> 33:43.530
It's also the office for the four of us.

831
33:44.920 --> 33:45.830
Which four?

832
33:46.000 --> 33:47.660
One's in emergency medicine.

833
33:47.920 --> 33:49.640
I'm from cardiothoracic surgery.

834
33:49.640 --> 33:51.510
The three of us rotate through surgery,

835
33:51.510 --> 33:53.070
along with you and Dr. Che.

836
33:53.960 --> 33:55.110
Don't you have dedicated

837
33:55.110 --> 33:56.440
emergency surgeons?

838
33:57.000 --> 33:58.130
This place is small.

839
34:02.270 --> 34:03.830
This desk is yours.

840
34:04.160 --> 34:05.830
There's the duty roster over there.

841
34:05.830 --> 34:07.030
We're not a big hospital

842
34:07.030 --> 34:07.830
with a day shift, a night shift, and a day off.

843
34:07.830 --> 34:08.840
We work day and night shifts in rotation,

844
34:08.840 --> 34:10.230
with 3 teams taking turns.

845
34:10.230 --> 34:11.230
No weekends off.

846
34:11.280 --> 34:12.550
You're on the day shift today,

847
34:12.550 --> 34:14.590
until 4 this afternoon.

848
34:16.960 --> 34:17.480
Okay.

849
34:17.590 --> 34:18.510
You're all set.

850
34:34.000 --> 34:35.800
Slacking off isn't the problem.

851
34:36.110 --> 34:38.030
The important thing is to let people know

852
34:38.030 --> 34:39.230
you're slacking off.

853
34:50.400 --> 34:52.920
Turn the volume all the way up.

854
34:52.960 --> 34:54.150
Make sure everyone knows

855
34:54.150 --> 34:56.480
what you're listening to or watching.

856
34:56.480 --> 34:57.320
You have to disturb them

857
34:57.320 --> 34:58.780
to get the desired result.

858
35:05.400 --> 35:06.630
You watch dramas too?

859
35:07.070 --> 35:08.670
Which one are you following?

860
35:13.840 --> 35:14.700
Just whatever.

861
35:15.710 --> 35:17.230
Pick this thing up.

862
35:17.880 --> 35:19.280
You need to pick it up and

863
35:19.480 --> 35:20.630
rub it

864
35:20.630 --> 35:22.110
to make that grating sound

865
35:22.230 --> 35:24.360
the kind that makes your teeth ache.

866
35:24.510 --> 35:26.510
Making noise is the important part.

867
35:31.030 --> 35:32.550
Smack your lips.

868
35:32.550 --> 35:33.710
That's right. Spray it out.

869
35:33.710 --> 35:34.670
The more you spray, the better.

870
35:34.670 --> 35:35.400
Right in their face.

871
35:35.400 --> 35:37.200
Got phlegm stuck in your throat?

872
35:37.320 --> 35:38.780
There's water over there.

873
35:44.760 --> 35:45.710
You're awake?

874
35:46.480 --> 35:47.400
Woke up hungry.

875
35:47.400 --> 35:48.530
Got anything to eat?

876
35:54.360 --> 35:55.550
Let me introduce him.

877
35:55.550 --> 35:57.550
This is our new guy, Liu Zhengliang.

878
36:00.190 --> 36:01.450
Hi, welcome, welcome!

879
36:01.960 --> 36:03.000
Sorry about that.

880
36:04.070 --> 36:06.330
I'm Huang Dongsheng. Just call me Huang.

881
36:06.440 --> 36:07.400
Nice to meet you.

882
36:10.230 --> 36:12.920
You just got here and you're already treating us?

883
36:12.920 --> 36:14.180
Then I won't hold back.

884
36:14.320 --> 36:15.580
I'll take one of these.

885
36:16.280 --> 36:17.680
And another one of these.

886
36:20.360 --> 36:21.230
Where... where are you...

887
36:21.230 --> 36:22.290
Where are you from?

888
36:22.590 --> 36:23.230
Shenzhen.

889
36:23.960 --> 36:24.880
Shenzhen?

890
36:24.880 --> 36:26.680
That's a special economic zone!

891
36:29.110 --> 36:31.510
Even when you sleep, you need to make some noise.

892
36:31.510 --> 36:33.440
After you put on the neck pillow...

893
36:36.880 --> 36:38.680
I'm sleepy. I'm gonna take a nap.

894
36:39.480 --> 36:42.080
You don't sound sleepy. That was one loud yawn.

895
36:42.480 --> 36:43.540
What are you doing?

896
36:45.840 --> 36:46.770
What do you mean?

897
36:47.190 --> 36:48.190
Can't I sleep?

898
36:48.230 --> 36:49.030
No.

899
36:57.800 --> 36:59.660
Come over here and sleep. Come on.

900
37:00.030 --> 37:00.880
Come here.

901
37:04.400 --> 37:05.710
What's with that thing around your neck?

902
37:05.710 --> 37:07.000
None of this stuff works.

903
37:07.000 --> 37:07.800
Come here. Listen to me.

904
37:07.800 --> 37:08.860
Come on, over here.

905
37:10.760 --> 37:11.550
You...

906
37:11.550 --> 37:13.150
Come on, sit tight.

907
37:13.150 --> 37:14.210
Come on, sit tight.

908
37:17.280 --> 37:18.150
Lie flat.

909
37:18.710 --> 37:20.110
Doesn't that feel great?

910
37:20.110 --> 37:21.630
You need to enjoy life. You...

911
37:21.630 --> 37:22.830
What the heck is this?

912
37:29.150 --> 37:30.210
Feels good, right?

913
37:32.880 --> 37:33.840
Close your eyes.

914
37:35.400 --> 37:36.190
Relax.

915
37:38.440 --> 37:39.230
Shenzhen.

916
37:40.190 --> 37:42.790
I think I had a classmate who lived in Shenzhen.

917
38:20.000 --> 38:22.320
At that moment, I could think of only one thing.

918
38:22.320 --> 38:24.800
A bad environment slowly kills you.

919
38:25.280 --> 38:26.710
I figured there was a 99% chance

920
38:26.710 --> 38:28.510
I couldn't survive in this dump.

921
38:28.840 --> 38:30.440
I left a 1% chance open,

922
38:30.880 --> 38:32.810
thanks to my instincts as a doctor.

923
38:33.960 --> 38:36.090
I've always been a meticulous person.

924
38:36.980 --> 38:41.070
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

925
38:37.440 --> 38:38.640
There's a slope here.

926
38:41.630 --> 38:42.440
Okay.

927
38:43.510 --> 38:44.710
There's another one.

928
38:46.220 --> 38:48.090
[Emergency Vehicle Access; No Parking]

929
38:48.580 --> 38:52.040
[No Passengers Allowed]

930
38:48.800 --> 38:50.130
We're here. We're here.

931
38:52.960 --> 38:54.670
Why'd you bring me here?

932
38:54.670 --> 38:55.550
To see a doctor.

933
38:55.840 --> 38:56.590
Well...

934
38:56.880 --> 38:58.960
I haven't finished my work yet.

935
38:58.960 --> 39:00.560
Forget about that. Hurry up.

936
39:00.760 --> 39:02.400
What are you doing?

937
39:02.400 --> 39:03.480
Listen to me, Mom.

938
39:04.030 --> 39:06.400
What are you doing?

939
39:04.310 --> 39:06.210
[Entrance]

940
39:10.480 --> 39:11.740
Why are you getting up?

941
39:11.760 --> 39:12.840
Just lie down.

942
39:13.510 --> 39:14.670
I'm not used to this.

943
39:15.880 --> 39:16.800
You just got here.

944
39:16.800 --> 39:17.590
It's normal

945
39:17.590 --> 39:19.190
to feel a little out of place.

946
39:19.360 --> 39:20.190
Tonight, I'd like to

947
39:20.190 --> 39:21.150
buy you a couple of drinks.

948
39:21.150 --> 39:22.840
Let me give you a proper welcome.

949
39:22.840 --> 39:23.760
Then I'll tell you all about

950
39:23.760 --> 39:25.420
how things work at Xiaoximen.

951
39:26.150 --> 39:27.190
I don't drink.

952
39:29.230 --> 39:30.760
I couldn't drink at first either.

953
39:30.760 --> 39:32.030
After a few times, I got used to it.

954
39:32.030 --> 39:33.800
I trained Zhang to hold his liquor.

955
39:33.800 --> 39:34.510
Zhang.

956
39:34.510 --> 39:35.590
Zhang. Zhang.

957
39:36.630 --> 39:38.160
Let's go drinking tonight.

958
39:41.840 --> 39:43.400
I've got plans tonight.

959
39:43.760 --> 39:44.710
I'll pass.

960
39:45.000 --> 39:46.190
What plans?

961
39:46.280 --> 39:47.800
Maybe next time.

962
39:48.400 --> 39:50.660
There's a patient in emergency surgery.

963
39:59.000 --> 40:00.000
Dr. Liu,

964
40:00.000 --> 40:00.630
why don't you go?

965
40:00.630 --> 40:02.890
It'll be a good chance to learn the ropes.

966
40:20.710 --> 40:23.510
I thought we'd finally got someone who could work.

967
40:28.440 --> 40:30.320
[Xiaoximen Hospital; Name: Liu Zhengliang]

968
40:32.590 --> 40:34.360
We're screwed. It's Duan.

969
40:36.550 --> 40:37.280
What do we do?

970
40:38.320 --> 40:39.050
What do we do?

971
40:40.000 --> 40:42.230
Should I go?

972
40:43.480 --> 40:44.510
If it's Duan,

973
40:44.510 --> 40:46.320
it's just a formality anyway.

974
40:46.320 --> 40:47.320
It makes no difference who goes.

975
40:47.320 --> 40:49.190
What are you talking about? I went last time.

976
40:49.190 --> 40:50.110
No, no, don't do that.

977
40:50.110 --> 40:52.070
You just said you'd go.

978
40:52.190 --> 40:53.120
Come on, enough.

979
40:59.630 --> 41:00.710
Who's Duan?

980
41:01.230 --> 41:03.030
My mom has this pain on the right side of her lower back.

981
41:03.030 --> 41:04.230
It comes in waves

982
41:04.320 --> 41:05.630
and shoots downward.

983
41:06.280 --> 41:08.480
It's so bad she can barely straighten up.

984
41:08.480 --> 41:10.320
Do you also feel bloated in your lower abdomen?

985
41:10.320 --> 41:11.550
Her lower abdomen is bloated too.

986
41:11.550 --> 41:12.630
She took painkillers,

987
41:12.630 --> 41:13.670
but they didn't help.

988
41:13.670 --> 41:15.670
Now she's running a high fever

989
41:15.670 --> 41:17.000
and shivering.

990
41:17.000 --> 41:18.000
Please give her a proper examination.

991
41:18.000 --> 41:19.730
What's wrong with her, Doctor?

992
41:19.920 --> 41:21.480
Let's run a few tests first.

993
41:21.480 --> 41:22.810
I'm not doing any tests.

994
41:25.360 --> 41:26.320
Director Duan,

995
41:26.070 --> 41:30.490
[Emergency Room 18]

996
41:26.320 --> 41:27.360
if you won't get checked,

997
41:27.360 --> 41:29.820
how am I supposed to figure out what's wrong?

998
41:35.550 --> 41:36.800
Why not just put me

999
41:36.800 --> 41:37.960
on an IV?

1000
41:37.960 --> 41:40.360
How can I give you an IV without examining you first?

1001
41:40.360 --> 41:42.360
At least get a complete blood count.

1002
41:42.440 --> 41:43.360
It only costs a few dozen yuan.

1003
41:43.360 --> 41:44.510
That's cheaper than at a big hospital.

1004
41:44.510 --> 41:45.880
No way.

1005
41:45.880 --> 41:48.110
I've got a ton of things waiting for me.

1006
